      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as ORD-0001: sertraline 600 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note to the order saying the dose is above the 200 mg/day maximum and that you confirmed it was intentional. The note also recommends pharmacy verification and monitoring.\n\nAt this dose, consider:\n- **Monitoring:** Watch for signs of serotonin syndrome (agitation, tremor, clonus, hyperthermia, tachycardia) and for seizures. A baseline ECG and follow-up ECGs would help assess QT.\n- **Drug interactions:** Check the patient's other medications for serotonergic or QT-prolonging drugs.\n- **Pharmacy:** Pharmacy may contact you to verify the dose."
      }
     ],
